## BusinessAccessRelationshipsApi

### Create a Brand Account
## Create a Brand Account
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/business_access/business_hierarchy/{{business_hierarchy_id}}/brand_accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "about": "<string>",
 "country": "<string>",
 "name": "<string>",
 "profile_image": "<string>",
 "username": "<string>",
 "website": "<string>"
}


### Update a Brand Account
## Update a Brand Account
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/business_access/business_hierarchy/{{business_hierarchy_id}}/brand_accounts/{{brand_account_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "about": "<string>",
 "country": "<string>",
 "name": "<string>",
 "profile_image": "<string>",
 "username": "<string>",
 "website": "<string>"
}


### Terminate business memberships
## Terminate business memberships
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/{{business_id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "members": "<string>"
}


### Terminate business partnerships
## Terminate business partnerships
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/{{business_id}}/partners
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "partner_ids": "<string>",
 "partner_type": "<string>"
}


### List business employers for user
## List business employers for user
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/employers?assetsSummary={{assetsSummary}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Get business members
## Get business members
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/{{business_id}}/members?fetchSystemUsers={{fetchSystemUsers}}&assetsSummary={{assetsSummary}}&businessRoles={{businessRoles}}&memberIds={{memberIds}}&startIndex={{startIndex}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Get business partners
## Get business partners
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/{{business_id}}/partners?assetsSummary={{assetsSummary}}&partnerType={{partnerType}}&partnerIds={{partnerIds}}&startIndex={{startIndex}}&sortAscending={{sortAscending}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Update a system user information.
## Update a system user information.
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/{{business_id}}/system_users/{{system_user_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "name": "<string>"
}


### Update member&#39;s business role
## Update member&#39;s business role
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/{{business_id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

